{"task": "With Uber's H3 geospatial library, convert latitude 37.775 and longitude -122.418 into the hexagonal cell index that contains them at resolution 9", "expected_qualname": "h3.latlng_to_cell"}
{"task": "Given an H3 cell index '8928308280fffff', recover the latitude and longitude of its centroid using the h3 library", "expected_qualname": "h3.cell_to_latlng"}
